  "notes": "A walking machine on the humanoid frame: the same eighteen bones, painted as plate and gunmetal, with a lit visor across the face and three recesses for lamps, one on each collar above where a gun held in both hands lies across the chest, and one between the shoulder blades. The plates are near white on purpose, because the shooter tints a bot by whose side it is on and a tint can only ever darken. The lamps themselves are not here: they carry the bot's health, and health is state rather than shape, so src/brain/avatar.rs draws them into the recesses. This is what the deathmatch bots are drawn as.",
